    12	**Flags**: Parse flags from the start of `$ARGUMENTS` before consuming the positional tail. **Public argv** allows only `--trivial`, `--simple`, `--hard`, `--no-dedup`, and `--run-id` (see table). **All boolean flags default to `false`.** At most one tier flag may appear on argv (mutual exclusion). If no tier flag is set after the clarify / already-planned routers in Step 0, the orchestrator MUST run the tier `AskUserQuestion` gate there before sketches.
