    18	| `--hard` | `false` | Tier: `sketch_budget=4`, `quick_mode=false`, `review_budget=full` (4 sketches + panel + per-finding approval on accepted findings) |
    19	| `--no-dedup` | `false` | Forward to `/larch:issue` when the verbal path creates a tracking issue |
    20	| `--run-id <ID>` | empty | Optional run identifier |
    21	
