    51	
    52	```
    53	📊 Sketches (regular): | Cursor-Arch: ⏳ | Cursor-Edge: ✅ 3m5s | Codex-Innovation: ❌ 8m3s | Codex-Pragmatic: ✅ 4m2s |
    54	
    55	📊 Sketches (quick): | Cursor-Generic: ⏳ | Codex-Generic: ✅ 3m5s |
