    61	
    62	Icons: ✅ done (with elapsed time since launch), ⏳ pending/in-progress, ❌ failed/timeout (with elapsed time since launch), ⊘ skipped (unavailable). This replaces individual per-agent completion messages. → shared/progress-reporting.md
