docs/linting.md:244:| `make test-implement-step2-routing` | Run the structural harness for `/implement` Step 1 implementer selection (`### Implementer waterfall` in `skills/implement/SKILL.md`; Step 2 dispatch consumes the resolved `--coder`). Exercises `scripts/test-implement-step2-routing.sh`, pinning that section, omitted-`--coder` Cursor → Codex → Claude waterfall, explicit-coder bypass, `coder_fallback=true` manifest flag, `/design` `diff-lines.txt` export, the clause that exported `diff_lines` / `diff-lines.txt` do not select the implementer, denylisted removed carve-out literals, and review-health routing pins. A `make lint` prerequisite via the `test-harnesses-N` shard partition. |
