docs/linting.md:264:| `make test-implement-review-token-propagation` | Run the offline nested `/implement` → `/review` token-context harness. Exercises `skills/implement/scripts/test-implement-review-token-propagation.sh`, covering `session-setup.sh --caller-env` forwarding for `LARCH_TOKEN_SESSION_ID` / `LARCH_CLAUDE_SOURCE_FILE`, validated `LARCH_TIMING_LEDGER` writer passthrough without stdout emission, safe rehydration with `read-session-env-key.sh`, and a PATH-stubbed Cursor review launcher receiving the parent token session id. A `make lint` prerequisite via the `test-harnesses-N` shard partition. |
docs/linting.md:265:| `make test-codex-implementer` | Run the offline launcher-contract harness for `scripts/launch-codex-implement.sh`. Exercises `skills/implement/scripts/test-codex-implementer.sh` with a PATH-stubbed `codex` binary, covering flag validation, timeout handling (including zero-valued multi-digit `0`/`00`/`000`), missing input files, KV-only stdout, Codex argv shape (`exec`, `--full-auto`, `-C`, two `--add-dir` grants — session tmpdir then repo root — `--output-last-message`, model flags, `--` separator before the prompt), per-invocation `CODEX_HOME` instructions config, dynamic-only prompt sidecar, parent-mismatch and missing-session-tmpdir fail-fast (tests 11/12), transcript capture, and resume-block prompt composition. A `make lint` prerequisite via the `test-harnesses-N` shard partition. |
docs/linting.md:266:| `make test-cursor-implementer` | Run the offline launcher-contract harness for `scripts/launch-cursor-implement.sh`. Exercises `skills/implement/scripts/test-cursor-implementer.sh` with a PATH-stubbed `cursor` binary, covering flag validation, KV-only stdout, `--capture-stdout-only`, `--output-format json`, Cursor argv shape parity with `launch-review.sh --tool cursor`, absence of a `--` separator before the prompt, and mandatory `cursor-wrap-prompt.sh` wrapping. A `make lint` prerequisite via the `test-harnesses-N` shard partition. |
