docs/linting.md:268:| `make test-render-run-summary` | Run the offline harness for `scripts/render-run-summary.sh` (shared `/implement` + `/fix-issue` run-summary markdown). Exercises `scripts/test-render-run-summary.sh` — golden-path body + sentinel + appended notes + `TOTAL ~$…` cost line, all-N/A and partial-N/A cost semantics, and stderr `STATUS=ok` / `OUTPUT_FILE=` pins for `--print-stdout`. A `make lint` prerequisite via the `test-harnesses-7` shard partition. |
