est-session-setup-presence-defaults.sh:1-91\tpresence defaults harness shrunk vs planned matrix\tedge combinations for stdout/session-env presence keys no longer regression-tested\trestore old matrix adapted to PRESENT keys\n1\tin_scope\tnit\trisk-integration\tscripts/dispatch-with-waterfall.sh:264-306\tWARN cost-fallback uses Phase-3 launch attempts including failures\tWARN can fire without successful Claude completions\trename KV or gate WARN on successful Phase-3 only\n1\tout_of_scope\tnit\tarchitecture\tlarch-logs/implement/443D5F3B-8C58-4765-B325-16924E02A34F/\tcommitted implement run artifacts ship in branch\tdiff noise not a script logic bug\tomit from PR or move to non-committed storage\n1\tout_of_scope\tnit\tcode-quality\tCHANGELOG.md\thistorical HEALTHY mentions remain\tacceptance grep excluded changelog\tretain or scrub separately from runtime dirs\n```\n  ```\n"}
