n1\tin_scope\tlatent\tarchitecture\tscripts/test-dispatch-with-waterfall.sh:1-88\tWaterfall regression harness thinner than planned matrix\tsemantic regressions in WARN counter DISPATCH_OK slip through\tAdd tests from plan or align docs\n1\tin_scope\tnit\trisk-integration\tskills/review/scripts/dispatch-panel.sh:128-133 scripts/dispatch-code-voters.sh:113-118\tWord splitting when parsing ALL_OUTPUT_FILES paths\tpaths containing spaces break voter path assignment\tAvoid IFS splitting or encode paths safely\n1\tout_of_scope\tnit\tcode-quality\tlarch-logs/implement/443D5F3B-8C58-4765-B325-16924E02A34F/plan-goals-test.md:1-260\tStale HEALTHY tokens in committed log prose\tUnscoped git grep noise\tScope acceptance grep or strip logs\n```\n  ```\n"}
./larch-logs/implement/443D5F3B-8C58-4765-B325-16924E02A34F/execution-issues.ndjson:32:{"phase":"implement","step":"7a","category":"Out-of-Scope Observations","source":"execution-issues.md pre-bump","source_sha256":"6d96b6534a5b89f7d44174b5ab9244bd255db3f2fc0f119df6b4a40665a8178a","body":"\n1. **Nit** (`architecture`, out of scope: **noise / process**)  \n   The branch diff includes committed [`larch-logs/implement/443D5F3B-8C58-4765-B325-16924E02A34F/…`](larch-logs/implement/) artifacts (large, not runtime surface). Not a logic bug in the feature, but it inflates review/CI noise; consider dropping from the PR if unintended.\n\n---\n\n**TSV (copy to sidecar if needed; tabs between fields)**\n\n```text\nschema_version\tscope\tseverity\tfocus_area\tlocation\twhat\tscenario_or_breakage\tsuggested_fix\n1\tin_scope\timportant\tcorrectness\tscripts/dispatch-with-waterfall.sh:178-206\tcollect_phase matches REVIEWER_FILE only to the phase output path\tAfter empty-output retry success collect-agent-results emits REVIEWER_FILE=<original>-retry.txt; awk looks for REVIEWER_FILE=<original>; STATUS stays empty; OK slot treated as failed → spurious Phase2/3 and wrong ALL_OUTPUT_FILES\tCorrelate summary blocks by argv order or accept -retry sibling paths\n1\tin_scope\timportant\tcorrectness\tscripts/launch-claude-review.sh:67-77 scripts/dispatch-with-waterfall.sh:132-153\tPhase-3 Claude reviewer omits competition notice even when panel enables it\tSlots on Cursor/Codex get render-specialist --competition-notice; Phase-3 Claude agent-file path never adds it → inconsistent prompts across fallback tiers\tPlumb --competition-notice (or equivalent) into launch-claude-review render_args when COMPETITION_NOTICE=true\n1\tin_scope\timportant\trisk-integration\tdocs/workflow-lifecycle.md:168\tDocs still say /review both-down yields empty specialist panel\tWaterfall launches Claude for all slots when both externals absent; operators following workflow-lifecycle get wrong mental model\tRewrite bullet to describe three-phase waterfall + Claude Phase3\n1\tin_scope\tlatent\tcorrectness\tscripts/launch-claude-subprocess.sh:117-143\tUnquoted array expansion in context-file loops splits paths on whitespace\tContext path with space becomes multiple wrong paths; context injection breaks or fails validation\tUse quoted \"${CONTEXT_FILES[@]}\" / \"${CONTEXT_CANON[@]}\" or indexed loop\n1\tin_scope\tnit\tarchitecture\tscripts/test-dispatch-with-waterfall.sh:1-88\tMissing planned regression cases (WARN threshold, Phase-3 hard fail)\tPlan listed five scenarios; harness ships three; threshold and hard-fail paths may regress\tAdd stubbed cases for DISPATCH_OK=false and WARN=cost-fallback-exceeded-threshold\n1\tin_scope\tnit\trisk-integration\tREADME.md:84 docs/skills.md:95\t“unhealthy” wording for voting Claude replacement\tPresence/waterfall model no longer matches “unhealthy” phrasing\tUpdate prose to unavailable/presence/waterfall language\n1\tout_of_scope\tnit\tarchitecture\tlarch-logs/implement/443D5F3B-8C58-4765-B325-16924E02A34F/*\tCommitted implement run logs in PR diff\tNot introduced logic defect; increases diff noise and review cost\tTrim from PR if accidental\n```\n  ```\n"}
